b.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"For YCQL online schema migration, `SysTablesEntryPB::ALTERING` is set when the table is altering and cleared when there are no more altering steps.  Altering steps are when you go from one index permission to another.  Since they happen right after each other, there's no need to clear the `ALTERING` state: it would just enter the next alter anyway.\r\n\r\nFor YSQL, it's not really the same.  There's some history behind it:\r\n\r\nAt first, YSQL online schema migration did a zigzag of updating permissions on DocDB side then on postgres side.  When DocDB waited for postgres permissions to update, the table wasn't really altering (i.e. there was no ongoing `AlterTable` request to tservers on the indexed table).  Still, the table maintained `ALTERING` state.  At least it fully applied permissions so that both `fully_applied_schema` and `schema` were equal.\r\n\r\nNext, YSQL online schema migration used DocDB permissions less as the emphasis was on postgres side permissions.  Plus, the backfill step became something that postgres initiated.  Master was not waiting for the backfill step.  Like before, the table maintained `ALTERING` state until it went to a transient DocDB permission.  However, this time, it didn't fully apply permissions after update, particularly after replicating adding index info to table at `WRITE_AND_DELETE` permission.  The consequence is that a table that just returned from replicating `READ_WRITE_AND_DELETE` permission will not clear `ALTERING` state _and_ will not fully apply the `READ_WRITE_AND_DELETE` permission if there's another table going through online schema change that's adding index info with `WRITE_AND_DELETE` permission.  If that procedure crashes, things will remain unresolved: this is precisely https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6269#issue-735746516.  With work on issue #6270, starting backfill should fully apply permissions, so that alleviates this a bit, but a crash before backfill will still be bad.\r\n\r\nI'm not too familiar with the `ALTERING` state, but it seems to me that it makes more sense for it to be set when the table is going through some alter on tservers.  `MultiStageAlterTable::LaunchNextTableInfoVersionIfNecessary` and `MultiStageAlterTable::ClearAlteringState` are guarded by version number: it is a robust way to know if the table is altering (regurding docdb metadata).  Then, we should clear `ALTERING` after finishing `WRITE_AND_DELETE` alter.  It would be turned back on when we alter to the terminal state (or when we alter to `DO_BACKFILL` permission by issue #6218).\r\n\r\nThis may have unintended side affects.  Nevertheless, it is a solution to https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6269#issue-735746516 when we no longer have any permissions leading to `indexes_to_update`.  (It should also be safe from concurrency issues because we validate using version number.)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6284/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6284/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3965946547,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50Mzk2NTk0NjU0Nw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/3965946547","actor":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":"77a9e6d8d0602d97d95da85535c6c5959e6f28ad","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits/77a9e6d8d0602d97d95da85535c6c5959e6f28ad","created_at":"2020-11-06T07:46:13Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null}]